# #4010 — the first Document instances. Jeff, 2026-08-26: "im confused about why
# we made html when i asked to put in the graph."
#
# He was right. The first pass wrote two HTML files that CITED the model in one
# generated block. The design itself stayed outside the graph, so
# /products/pulse still answered hasDesignDoc ABSENT and /documents still 404'd.
# A document about the system that the system cannot see is a file, not a
# document.
#
# These two are the design of Pulse, as data. The HTML becomes a projection of
# them, not the other way round.

@prefix chorus: <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

chorus:doc-product-design-pulse a chorus:Document ;
    rdfs:label "Product Design — Pulse" ;
    chorus:docTitle "Product Design — Pulse" ;
    chorus:docHref "/designing/docs/product-design-pulse.html" ;
    rdfs:comment "What Pulse is FOR: Jeff looks once and knows whether his team is working, without asking anyone and without being lied to. Measured by how many times a day he has to ask — six on 2026-08-25." ;
    chorus:hasDomain chorus:memory ;
    chorus:hasProduct chorus:pulse ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:role-wren ;
    dcterms:created "2026-08-25T20:17:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-08-26T08:25:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

chorus:doc-service-design-pulse a chorus:Document ;
    rdfs:label "Service Design — Pulse" ;
    chorus:docTitle "Service Design — Pulse" ;
    chorus:docHref "/designing/docs/service-design-pulse.html" ;
    rdfs:comment "How Pulse works and where it currently lies: an event-bus cache, not an aggregator (Silas, 2026-04-21); 1 of 8 #2442 items shipped; the state field wrong by construction at pulse.rs:162, which is why 129 declaration cards never fixed it." ;
    chorus:hasDomain chorus:memory ;
    chorus:hasProduct chorus:pulse ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:role-wren ;
    dcterms:created "2026-04-21T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-08-26T08:25:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

# The edge the ProductShape floor has been asking for since #3603.
chorus:pulse chorus:hasDesignDoc chorus:doc-product-design-pulse , chorus:doc-service-design-pulse .
